Herdr integration assets
========================

The files in this directory are unmodified copies of the provider
integration assets from Herdr.

Project:    Herdr
Repository: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr
Ref:        preview-2026-08-31-b1ff4582e968
Commit:     b1ff4582e9688f52ffb943cfa8bee4871ae122e4
Source:     src/integration/assets
License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

These files are copied verbatim and are reference material only: Sidecar
does not install them, and nothing at runtime reads them. They exist so
that re-porting a provider is a review of a diff against the upstream a
Sidecar asset was written from. Sidecar's own assets live in ../assets,
and PortedFromRecords in ../portedfrom.go records which upstream version
each was written against.

TestVendoredIntegrationAssetsMatchLock fails if a byte here changes
without a matching entry in ../upstream.lock.json.

